MAIN

PRINT CALL BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 2 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 3 HALLOCATE 4
MOVE TEMP 4 HALLOCATE 4
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 ArrayExpr_TestArrayExpr
MOVE TEMP 5 4
L0	CJUMP LE TEMP 5 3 L1
HSTORE PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 5 0 0
MOVE TEMP 5 PLUS TEMP 5 4
JUMP L0
L1 HSTORE TEMP 4 0 TEMP 3
RETURN TEMP 4
END

HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 2 0
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 6 0
RETURN TEMP 7
END ( TEMP 2 )
END

ArrayExpr_TestArrayExpr [ 1 ]
BEGIN

MOVE TEMP 1 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 6 HALLOCATE  TIMES  PLUS 3 1  4
MOVE TEMP 7 4
L2 CJUMP  LE TEMP 7 MINUS  TIMES  PLUS 3 1  4  1 L3
HSTORE  PLUS TEMP 6 TEMP 7 0  0
MOVE TEMP 7 PLUS TEMP 7 4
JUMP L2
L3 HSTORE TEMP 6 0 3
RETURN TEMP 6
END


HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 0 4 5

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1 4 10

HSTORE PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 2 4 3

MOVE TEMP 3 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 8 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 8 4
RETURN TEMP 9
END


MOVE TEMP 4 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 10 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 4
RETURN TEMP 11
END


MOVE TEMP 2 PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 4

PRINT TEMP 2

MOVE TEMP 3 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 12 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1
HLOAD TEMP 13 TEMP 12 4
RETURN TEMP 13
END


MOVE TEMP 4 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 14 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 2
HLOAD TEMP 15 TEMP 14 4
RETURN TEMP 15
END


MOVE TEMP 2 TIMES TEMP 3 TEMP 4

PRINT TEMP 2

MOVE TEMP 3 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 16 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 17 TEMP 16 4
RETURN TEMP 17
END


MOVE TEMP 4 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 18 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 1
HLOAD TEMP 19 TEMP 18 4
RETURN TEMP 19
END


MOVE TEMP 5 BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 20 PLUS TEMP 1 TIMES 4 2
HLOAD TEMP 21 TEMP 20 4
RETURN TEMP 21
END


MOVE TEMP 4 TIMES TEMP 4 TEMP 5

MOVE TEMP 2 PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 4

PRINT TEMP 2

RETURN 0
END

